# Realtek RTL8730E (AmebaSmart) vendor blobs and build artefacts.
#
# These are NOT NuttX source and must never be committed upstream (vendor
# blobs are kept out of the NuttX tree).  They are vendor outputs from the
# ameba-rtos SDK, placed here by the integrator:
#
#   libs/*.a / libs/wifi_obj/*.o   pre-compiled chip archives + WiFi glue
#   bl2.bin / bl32.bin / boot.bin  prebuilt secure-boot / KM4-KM0 blobs
#   vendor_prefix.bin              image header prepended to the AP image
#   platform_autoconf.h            static minimal header maintained in-tree
#                                  (NOT from SDK menuconfig; only the defines
#                                  our fwlib sources actually need)
#   fiptool                        vendored FIP packaging tool binary
#   *_uuid.txt                     FIP entry UUIDs for the packer
#
# Everything in this directory is ignored, except platform_autoconf.h which
# is a hand-maintained NuttX-side file that must be present on a clean clone.

*
!.gitignore
!platform_autoconf.h
